import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'no-target':('Shot-lining flow asks about firing with no target','The Borg carries a bow and arrows and knows a kobold it cannot shoot from here. A movement-flow probe asks whether a distance attack exists while the target list is empty and the simulation flag is off — the state the Teleport Other defense and any acted attack leave behind. The original still enters the firing path: it reads the description of missile slot -1 and queues a fire key, a quiver character computed from index -1, and the target key. The correction returns "nothing to fire" without queueing anything.'),
 'live-shot':('Control: a real target fires normally','With the target list filled the way the attack chooser fills it, both versions queue the real firing keys and value the shot above zero. The logs are identical before and after the fix.'),
 'simulated':('Control: the same probe in simulation','With the simulation flag on and a filled target list both versions return the value of the best shot and queue nothing. The logs are identical before and after the fix.')}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw}
  for tag,key in (('DECISION','decision'),('OUTCOME','outcome')):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r' (.*)',raw)
   entry[key]={k:int(v) for k,v in re.findall(r'(\w+)=(-?\d+)',match[1])} if match else None
  entry['passed']='native-c/missile-254 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw
  entry['crash']='AddressSanitizer' in raw and 'READ of size' in raw
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>No target is no reason to fire</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native missile-launch probes</p><h1>The Borg can try to fire with no target chosen</h1><p>A Warrior with a bow and arrows knows a kobold it cannot shoot from where it stands. The shot-lining movement flow asks whether a distance attack exists; the target list is empty and the simulation flag is off, exactly the state earlier evaluations leave behind. The original launch routine then enters the firing path with missile index -1: it reads a description from before the inventory array and queues a fire key, a quiver character computed from index -1, and the target key.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p><br><button data-step="0">The probe</button><button data-step="1">Keys queued</button></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Original</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p><p class="action"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>Corrected</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p><p class="action"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the controls establish</h2><p>With a real target both versions queue the genuine firing keys and value the shot above zero; in simulation both value it and queue nothing. The logs of both controls match byte for byte. Only the no-target probe changes.</p><details><summary>Memory error evidence</summary><p>Under AddressSanitizer the original aborts inside the launch routine with a heap-buffer-overflow READ while formatting the note for missile slot -1 (borg-fight-attack.c); the corrected build runs the same probe cleanly and queues nothing.</p></details><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Warrior level 10, depth 10, seed 1000, lit constructed arena, a short bow, twenty arrows and a torch, one awake kobold five grids away. The production launch routine is called unchanged; the empty target list and the off simulation flag reproduce the state left by earlier evaluations in the shot-lining flow (the Teleport Other defense resets the target list; any acted attack or defense leaves the simulation flag off). This isolates the launch guard, not full autonomous play. No death or survival claim.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Original</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>Corrected</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/254">issue254</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;let step=1;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);p.querySelector('.num').textContent=step===0?'Asking for a distance attack.':`Keys queued: ${d.outcome?d.outcome.keys:'n/a'}`;p.querySelector('.state').textContent=step===0?`Return value: ${d.outcome?d.outcome.return:'n/a'}.`:'Each key would go to the game.';p.querySelector('.action').textContent=d.crash?'AddressSanitizer aborted formatting the note for missile slot -1.':step===1?(d.outcome&&d.outcome.keys===0?'Nothing queued: no target means no shot.':d.outcome&&d.outcome.keys>=3?'Real firing keys queued for a genuine target.':''):'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='no-target'?'The original queues three keys from index -1 and reads before the inventory array; the correction queues nothing.':'Both versions behave identically in this control; the logs match byte for byte.';for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]'))b.classList.toggle('active',Number(b.dataset.step)===step)}select.addEventListener('change',()=>{step=1;draw()});for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]'))b.addEventListener('click',()=>{step=Number(b.dataset.step);draw()});draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
